{"Time":"2026-09-25T10:59:58.019735364+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"go-wind-admin/app/admin/service/internal/service","Test":"TestOpenAPI","Output":"    描述: Requires user JWT or ANI HMAC-SHA256 signature, NETWORK subscription and network:vpc:get permission. vpc_id must be vpc_ followed by 32 lowercase hex digits. Query parameters and body are rejected. Public identity headers are ignored. The persisted tenant UUID is looked up from the trusted operator's tenant and replayed downstream. Cross-tenant and missing VPCs both return 404. No network lifecycle or data-plane operation is performed.\n"}
